{'symbol': 'ETR', 'date': '2023-06-21 12:11:00', 'title': 'ENTERGY TEXAS DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND ON PREFERRED STOCK', 'text': 'THE WOODLANDS, TEXAS , JUNE 21, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE ENTERGY TEXAS, INC. BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND PAYMENT OF $0.3359375 PER SHARE ON ITS SERIES A PREFERRED STOCK. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE JULY 15, 2023, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF JULY 3, 2023.'}